":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、神祇或未核指代，不能以後世故事補造姓名或合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p048:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"胡亥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p048:m0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、神祇或未核指代，不能以後世故事補造姓名或合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p048:m0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"虞舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p048:m0097","start":97,"end":98,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、神祇或未核指代，不能以後世故事補造姓名或合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p048:m0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"大禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p054:block01","text":"皇帝曰：「金石刻盡始皇帝所為也。今襲號而金石刻辭不稱始皇帝，其於久遠也如後嗣為之者，不稱成功盛德。」丞相臣斯、臣去疾、御史大夫臣德昧死言：「臣請具刻詔書刻石，因明白矣。臣昧死請。」制曰：「可。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p054:block01:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p054:block01:m0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"始皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p054:block01:m0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"始皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p054:block01:m0050","start":50,"end":54,"surface":"丞相臣斯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000537","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p054:block01:m0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"臣去疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000596","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p054:block01:m0059","start":59,"end":65,"surface":"御史大夫臣德","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000613","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_block_kind":"witness_dd","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060","text":"趙高說二世曰：「先帝臨制天下久，故群臣不敢為非，進邪說。今陛下富於春秋，初即位，柰何與公卿廷決事？事即有誤，示群臣短也。天子稱朕，固不聞聲。」於是二世常居禁中，與高決諸事。其後公卿希得朝見，盜賊益多，而關中卒發東擊盜者毋已。右丞相去疾、左丞相斯、將軍馮劫進諫曰：「關東群盜并起，秦發兵誅擊，所殺亡甚眾，然猶不止。盜多，皆以戌漕轉作事苦，賦稅大也。請且止阿房宮作者，減省四邊戍轉。」二世曰：「吾聞之韓子曰：『堯舜采椽不刮，茅茨不翦，飯土塯，啜土形，雖監門之養，不觳於此。禹鑿龍門，通大夏，決河亭水，放之海，身自持筑臿，脛毋毛，臣虜之勞不烈於此矣。』凡所為貴有天下者，得肆意極欲，主重明法，下不敢為非，以制御海內矣。夫虞、夏之主，貴為天子，親處窮苦之實，以徇百姓，尚何於法？朕尊萬乘，毋其實，吾欲造千乘之駕，萬乘之屬，充吾號名。且先帝起諸侯，兼天下，天下已定，外攘四夷以安邊竟，作宮室以章得意，而君觀先帝功業有緒。今朕即位二年之閒，群盜并起，君不能禁，又欲罷先帝之所為，是上毋以報先帝，次不為朕盡忠力，何以在位？」下去疾、斯、劫吏，案責他罪。去疾、劫曰：「將相不辱。」自殺。斯卒囚，就五刑。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000535","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"先帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、官稱或待核指代；未補姓名、闕代與親屬成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060:m0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"二世","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060:m0081","start":81,"end":82,"surface":"高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000535","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060:m0112","start":112,"end":117,"surface":"右丞相去疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000596","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p060:m0118","start":118,"end":122,"surface":"左丞相斯","kind":"person","person_id"